  "Description": "TAKEON\n\nThis process requires a user to enter/ select a TradingPartner Code that corresponds with the 3PL customer that owns the stock that is being taken on\n\nThere is validation on the CarryingEntity step that prevents stock belonging to more than 1 3PL customer being put on the same pallet.\nThe MasterItem step contains similar validation that prevents more than 1 3PL customer's stock from being put into the same location if the location's category is either PICKING or BULK",
